<title>POLAND: TENNIS-WARSAW CUP QUARTER-FINAL RESULTS.</title>
<headline>TENNIS-WARSAW CUP QUARTER-FINAL RESULTS.</headline>
<dateline>WARSAW 1997-07-25</dateline>
<text>
<p>Results of Warsaw Cup Woman's</p>
<p>tennis tournament quarter-finals on Friday (prefix number</p>
<p>denotes seeding):</p>
<p>Virginia Ruano Pascal (Spain) beat Joanette Kruger (South</p>
<p>Africa)</p>
<p>7-5 7-5</p>
<p>2-Ruxandra Dragomir (Romania) beat 8-Katarina Studenikova</p>
<p>(Slovakia)</p>
<p>6-2 6-3</p>
<p>6-Henrieta Nagoyova (Slovakia) beat Cristina Torrens Valero</p>
<p>(Spain)</p>
<p>6-3 6-1</p>
<p>1-Barbara Paulus (Austria) beat Gala Leon Garcia (Spain) 6-2</p>
<p>6-0</p>
</text>
